## Article 1. Citizens' Appeals

```catala
declaration scope Article1AppealRight:
  input author content AppealAuthor
  input appealType content AppealType
  input addressee content AddresseeType
  input concernsOfficialDuties content YesNo
  input isMilitaryOrPolice content YesNo
  input isForeigner content YesNo
  input internationalTreatyException content YesNo
  output hasAppealRight content YesNo
  output appealMustBeAccepted content YesNo

scope Article1AppealRight:
  label has_appeal_right_default
  definition hasAppealRight equals No

  label citizen_right exception has_appeal_right_default
  definition hasAppealRight under condition
    author.category = Citizen
    consequence equals Yes

  label military_right exception has_appeal_right_default
  definition hasAppealRight under condition
    isMilitaryOrPolice = Yes and concernsOfficialDuties = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label foreigner_right exception has_appeal_right_default
  definition hasAppealRight under condition
    isForeigner = Yes and internationalTreatyException = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label must_accept_default
  definition appealMustBeAccepted equals No

  label must_accept exception must_accept_default
  definition appealMustBeAccepted under condition
    hasAppealRight = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 2. Legislation on citizens' appeals

```catala
declaration scope Article2Exceptions:
  input isDepositGuaranteeFund content YesNo
  input isMilitaryOmbudsman content YesNo
  output lawApplies content YesNo

scope Article2Exceptions:
  label law_applies_default
  definition lawApplies equals Yes

  label deposit_fund_exception exception law_applies_default
  definition lawApplies under condition
    isDepositGuaranteeFund = Yes
    consequence equals No

  label military_ombudsman_exception exception law_applies_default
  definition lawApplies under condition
    isMilitaryOmbudsman = Yes
    consequence equals No
```
